      "definitive_description": "Quan Nguyen is a licensed Texas REALTOR\u00ae (license #0774451) with Walzel Properties, leading The Quantum Team. He specializes in buyer representation across the Katy-Houston metro area with extended service in Austin, Dallas, and the Rio Grande Valley. He holds five professional certifications (ABR, GRI, C2EX, MRP, PSA) and has closed 75+ transactions. His practice is 85% buyer-focused, serving first-time homebuyers, out-of-state relocators, and new-construction clients. Quan operates an AI-powered multilingual advisory service enabling seamless communication with buyers in any language.",
